OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,FDozens of officers and staff from
OL,7,FThames Valley and Hampshire are
OL,8,Fcycling hundreds of miles to raise
OL,9,Ffunds for the families of emergency
OL,10,Fworkers who lost their lives on duty.
OL,12,FPolice officers, staff, and bereaved
OL,13,Ffamilies are setting off on a major
OL,14,Fnational cycling challenge today to
OL,15,Fhonour fallen colleagues and raise
OL,16,Fmoney for charity.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/11
