CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,FThe UK Police Unity Tour sees hundreds
OL,7,Fof riders from across the country take
OL,8,Fto the road for its 14th year,
OL,9,Fsupporting Care of Police Survivors
OL,10,F(COPS) - a charity dedicated to
OL,11,Fhelping the families of officers who
OL,12,Fhave lost their lives in service.
OL,14,FWATCH: Thames Valley Police Chief
OL,15,FConstable Jason Hogg said: "it's
OL,16,Femotional for everybody".
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
