OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,FRepresenting the joint regional team,
OL,7,F47 riders and support staff from
OL,8,FThames Valley Police and Hampshire &
OL,9,FIsle of Wight Constabulary are taking
OL,10,Fpart in the multi-day event.
OL,12,FAmong those in the saddle is Thames
OL,13,FValley Police Chief Constable Jason
OL,14,FHogg, who admitted he had to borrow a
OL,15,Fbike for the journey.: "It brings a
OL,16,Fsense of service, of teamwork and of
OL,17,Fpurpose and reminds us why what we do
OL,18,Fis important,"
OL,26,@wD@XOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/11
