OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,F"I have done this cycle ride some
OL,7,Fyears ago, and at the end of the ride
OL,8,Fthere was a big group of children
OL,9,Fplaying in a park - every single one
OL,10,Fof those children had lost a mum or
OL,11,Fdad who'd been a police officer whilst
OL,12,Fserving. It really brings policing
OL,13,Ftogether and reminds us what we do and
OL,14,Fwhy we do it."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,FBefore setting off from Hampshire
OL,7,FConstabulary Headquarters in Netley,
OL,8,Fcyclists gathered for a memorial
OL,9,Fservice before embarking on a route
OL,10,Fthat takes them to the Thames Valley
OL,11,FPolice Training Centre in Sulhamstead,
OL,12,FBerkshire, before culminating at the
OL,13,FNational Memorial Arboretum in
OL,14,FStaffordshire.
OL,16,FThe combined regional group has
OL,17,Falready raised more than #25,000 ahead
OL,18,Fof this year's ride, with the local
OL,19,Fcontingent having raised around
OL,20,F#150,000 since first joining in 2018.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,FNigel Welham, a police civilian
OL,7,Femployee who helped first bring the
OL,8,Fforces together for the event,
OL,9,Fdescribed the ride as an emotional
OL,10,Frollercoaster: "The highs are really
OL,11,Fhigh and the lows can be really low,
OL,12,Fbut it's an event that I can't
OL,13,Fexperience anywhere else."
OL,26,@uD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,F"In 45 years in policing, it's one of
OL,7,Fthe biggest things that I've dealt
OL,8,Fwith in the whole service. It is a
OL,9,Fpromise that the sacrifice of our
OL,10,Ffallen officers, who gave everything,
OL,11,Fwill always be remembered and that we
OL,12,Fwill continue to support those left
OL,13,Fbehind."
OL,15,FFor Thames Valley Police, the tour
OL,16,Fcarries extra significance as cyclists
OL,17,Fpass near the site where PC Andrew
OL,18,FHarper was killed while responding to
OL,19,Fa burglary in Berkshire in 2019.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,FHis death inspired "Harper's Law,"
OL,7,Fwhich introduced mandatory life
OL,8,Fsentences for offenders convicted of
OL,9,Fkilling an emergency worker while
OL,10,Fcommitting a crime.
OL,12,FWATCH: Thames Valley Police Chief
OL,13,FConstable Jason Hogg feels "let down"
OL,14,Fby the justice system over the planned
OL,15,Frelease of PC Andrew Harper's killers
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,FThe ride also comes as police leaders,
OL,7,Fincluding Chief Constable Hogg, urge
OL,8,Fthe government to reconsider early
OL,9,Fprison release plans that could affect
OL,10,Ftwo of the men convicted over PC
OL,11,FHarper's death.
OL,13,FRecalling the night PC Harper died,
OL,14,FChief Constable Hogg shared the
OL,15,Flasting impact on his team: "It was
OL,16,Fthrough the course of the night that
OL,17,Fthe horror of what happened unfolded.
OL,18,FWe literally lost an officer... and
OL,19,Fthen found out Andrew had been killed
OL,20,Fin horrific, horrific circumstances.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,F"The team did not want to go home
OL,7,Fbecause they knew when they went home
OL,8,Fand finally got some sleep after a
OL,9,Flong shift, when they woke up the next
OL,10,Fday, it would all be real and they
OL,11,Fwouldn't be seeing Andrew again."
OL,13,FAddressing the current discussions
OL,14,Faround early release, Chief Constable
OL,15,FHogg added: "The impact of Andrew's
OL,16,Fkillers being released... has had such
OL,17,Fan impact on Andrew's family who feel
OL,18,Flet down by the justice system, but
OL,19,Falso officers and staff in policing in
OL,20,FThames Valley, Hampshire and across
OL,21,Fthe UK.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/11
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,388,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1786088871
OL,3,CGruelling cycling challenge in tribute
OL,4,Cto fallen officers and their families
OL,6,F"Events such as the Unity Tour ensure
OL,7,Fthat officers who have lost their
OL,8,Flives in service are never forgotten
OL,9,Fand that those they leave behind
OL,10,Fcontinue to receive support."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/11
